'''''Meryta lanceolata''''' is a species of [[flowering plant]] in the family [[Araliaceae]]. It is a tree [[Endemism|endemic]] to the islands of [[Bora Bora]] and [[Tahiti]] in the [[Society Islands]] of [[French Polynesia]].<ref name = powo/>

